{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/3f6e53dea18aab33bae8db27296d14b5.poster.avif?t=1772454351\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/3f6e53dea18aab33bae8db27296d14b5.webm?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/3f6e53dea18aab33bae8db27296d14b5.mp4?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorami is a chill two-player puzzle platformer where you solve puzzles using the powers of color on the map. You change the colors of platforms and use unique properties of each color to affect your environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no need for fast reflexes here. This is a journey of logic, experimentation, and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The demo version contains a selection of levels to be experienced in local co-op only.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/47893d8138ed9c7b71b2be6e09db4243.avif?t=1772454351\" alt=\"Recolor The Platforms And Solve Puzzles\" width=1560 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colors define the rules of reality. By changing your character\u2019s color palette, you gain powers to change the color of platforms on the map. You can recolor them as much as you like, which can lead to surprising and satisfying ways of solving the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a small ecosystem, designed to be explored, understood, and solved at your own pace. Some levels have more than one solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/c3b436245f49c724ceaedba83557e878.poster.avif?t=1772454351\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/c3b436245f49c724ceaedba83557e878.webm?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/c3b436245f49c724ceaedba83557e878.mp4?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/a50a7eacd051aba84edae1f77de70b9a.avif?t=1772454351\" alt=\"Two Spirits Painting Together\" width=1560 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a local or online co-op, two players work side by side to navigate the world, each with their own ideas, perspectives, and roles in the puzzle solving process. Colorami was created to be explored together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/bc13c68cdb9009f2a69b10ee4dd36c07.poster.avif?t=1772454351\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/bc13c68cdb9009f2a69b10ee4dd36c07.webm?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/bc13c68cdb9009f2a69b10ee4dd36c07.mp4?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/7ef946d9477eaf93335d94f48956a95f.avif?t=1772454351\" alt=\"Asymmetric Puzzle Design\" width=1560 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need someone to open a path while you're standing on a moving platform?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our levels are designed for cooperative problem solving, and each player can use their color independently. One player can manipulate platforms while the other moves through a newly opened area. Or they can carry color between distant parts of the map.\u00a0Coordination and communication are the key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/1f97c341c7f0ec85c2cd3eabbccd8a8f.poster.avif?t=1772454351\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/1f97c341c7f0ec85c2cd3eabbccd8a8f.webm?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/1f97c341c7f0ec85c2cd3eabbccd8a8f.mp4?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/ab4c783870e9a27d3115cd4091d33f0e.apng?t=1772454351\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/ab4c783870e9a27d3115cd4091d33f0e.poster.avif?t=1772454351\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Spirit 1 jumping with joy\" width=144 height=192 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/45a1c5707901d241b6d21d3e86c80217.apng?t=1772454351\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/45a1c5707901d241b6d21d3e86c80217.poster.avif?t=1772454351\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Spirit 2 jumping with joy\" width=144 height=192 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001780?t=1772454351","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/15587491c446d92dd67ae27ad7d3ec2323442b27/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772454351","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/e57bd5eec39805646d24b1a0bd93eb3fa68aff72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772454351","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/e57bd5eec39805646d24b1a0bd93eb3fa68aff72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772454351","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4022340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color the world: Repaint platforms to solve puzzles. Each color has a unique property that helps you affect the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asymmetric puzzles: each level is a separate puzzle that needs to be solved by two.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single screen levels with beautiful hand drawn 2D pixel art: cute spirits, breathtaking backgrounds, and gameplay elements that will catch your eye.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-punishing gameplay: you can restart the current level any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local two-player co-op: available in our demo and in the full game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online two-player co-op: coming in the full game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xbox and PlayStation controller support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared keyboard mode, where you can bind keys to two players.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/3f6e53dea18aab33bae8db27296d14b5.poster.avif?t=1772454351\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/3f6e53dea18aab33bae8db27296d14b5.webm?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/3f6e53dea18aab33bae8db27296d14b5.mp4?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorami is a chill two-player puzzle platformer where you solve puzzles using the powers of color on the map. You change the colors of platforms and use unique properties of each color to affect your environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no need for fast reflexes here. This is a journey of logic, experimentation, and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The demo version contains a selection of levels to be experienced in local co-op only.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/47893d8138ed9c7b71b2be6e09db4243.avif?t=1772454351\" alt=\"Recolor The Platforms And Solve Puzzles\" width=1560 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colors define the rules of reality. By changing your character\u2019s color palette, you gain powers to change the color of platforms on the map. You can recolor them as much as you like, which can lead to surprising and satisfying ways of solving the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a small ecosystem, designed to be explored, understood, and solved at your own pace. Some levels have more than one solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/c3b436245f49c724ceaedba83557e878.poster.avif?t=1772454351\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/c3b436245f49c724ceaedba83557e878.webm?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/c3b436245f49c724ceaedba83557e878.mp4?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/a50a7eacd051aba84edae1f77de70b9a.avif?t=1772454351\" alt=\"Two Spirits Painting Together\" width=1560 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a local or online co-op, two players work side by side to navigate the world, each with their own ideas, perspectives, and roles in the puzzle solving process. Colorami was created to be explored together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/bc13c68cdb9009f2a69b10ee4dd36c07.poster.avif?t=1772454351\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/bc13c68cdb9009f2a69b10ee4dd36c07.webm?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/bc13c68cdb9009f2a69b10ee4dd36c07.mp4?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/7ef946d9477eaf93335d94f48956a95f.avif?t=1772454351\" alt=\"Asymmetric Puzzle Design\" width=1560 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need someone to open a path while you're standing on a moving platform?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our levels are designed for cooperative problem solving, and each player can use their color independently. One player can manipulate platforms while the other moves through a newly opened area. Or they can carry color between distant parts of the map.\u00a0Coordination and communication are the key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/1f97c341c7f0ec85c2cd3eabbccd8a8f.poster.avif?t=1772454351\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/1f97c341c7f0ec85c2cd3eabbccd8a8f.webm?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/1f97c341c7f0ec85c2cd3eabbccd8a8f.mp4?t=1772454351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/ab4c783870e9a27d3115cd4091d33f0e.apng?t=1772454351\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/ab4c783870e9a27d3115cd4091d33f0e.poster.avif?t=1772454351\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Spirit 1 jumping with joy\" width=144 height=192 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/45a1c5707901d241b6d21d3e86c80217.apng?t=1772454351\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/45a1c5707901d241b6d21d3e86c80217.poster.avif?t=1772454351\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Spirit 2 jumping with joy\" width=144 height=192 /></picture></span></p>","developers":["Gryfyard"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/c3638ff70b81a0519678e7757ec6a77257306632/header.jpg?t=1772454351","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4001780/753983745/b6bdaf05ae9aa77b85add2e1747aeabe6e87e2c0/1762509931/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762510725","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4001780/753983745/b6bdaf05ae9aa77b